  "heading": "\\integers",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{the integers}\\quad\\htmlClass{mlg-title-written}{\\mathbb{Z}}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\integers]\nDefines: Zb ::= (Z, 0, 1, +, *, neg(z_), leq(a_, b_))\nabstractly:\nspecifies:\n. Z is \\set\n. 0 \"in\" Z\n. 1 \"in\" Z\n. + is \\binary.operation:on{Z}\n. * is \\binary.operation:on{Z}\n. neg is \\function:on{Z}:to{Z}\n. leq is \\total.order:on{Z}\nexpresses:\n. 0 != 1\n. forAll: a, b, c \"in\" Z\n  then:\n  . (a + b) + c = a + (b + c)\n  . a + b = b + a\n  . a + 0 = a\n  . a + neg(a) = 0\n  . (a * b) * c = a * (b * c)\n  . a * b = b * a\n  . a * 1 = a\n  . 1 * a = a\n  . a * (b + c) = (a * b) + (a * c)\n  . if: leq(a, b)\n    then: leq(a + c, b + c)\n. forAll: a, b \"in\" Z\n  where:\n  . leq(0, a)\n  . leq(0, b)\n  then: leq(0, a * b)\nEnables:\n. capability: z_ \"in\" Zb :-> z_ is \\integer\n. view:\n  as: S := Z is \\set\nDocumented:\n. called: \"the integers\"\n. written: \"\\mathbb{Z}\"\n. description: \"The integers $(\\mathbb{Z}, 0, 1, +, \\cdot, -)$ as an algebraic\n                ring constructed from the differences of natural numbers.\"\nId: \"fe3288e5-96fd-4839-bd2f-1bc13160214f\"",
